#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "## Using goat\n"
msgstr "<Heading level={2} id=\"using-goat\">goatの利用</Heading>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lexicons are designed to be machine-readable and network-accessible. While it is not currently *required* that a lexicon is available on the network, it is strongly advised to publish lexicon so that a single canonical & authoritative representation is available to consumers of the method.\n"
msgstr "Lexiconは機械可読かつネットワークアクセス可能なよう設計されています。現時点ではレキシコンがネットワーク上で利用可能であることは*必須*ではありませんが、利用者が単一の正規かつ信頼できる表現にアクセスできるよう、レキシコンを公開することを強く推奨します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [`goat`](https://github.com/bluesky-social/goat), our command line tool, for creating and publishing Lexicons. The Lexicon-related features are available under [`goat lex`](https://github.com/bluesky-social/goat?tab=readme-ov-file#lexicon-development) :\n"
msgstr "コマンドラインツール[`goat`](https://github.com/bluesky-social/goat)を使って、Lexiconを作成・公開できます。Lexicon関連の機能は[`goat lex`](https://github.com/bluesky-social/goat?tab=readme-ov-file#lexicon-development)にあります。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- publishing schemas to and synchronizing from the AT network\n"
"- diffing, linting, and verifying schema evolution rules\n"
msgstr ""
"- スキーマを公開してATネットワークと同期する\n"
"- スキーマの差分比較、lint、およびスキーマ進化ルールの検証\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "`goat` can be installed from [Homebrew](https://formulae.brew.sh/formula/goat) on macOS and Linux:\n"
msgstr "`goat`はmacOSとLinuxで[Homebrew](https://formulae.brew.sh/formula/goat)からインストールできます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"brew install goat\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```shell\n"
"brew install goat\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "In a project directory, you can download some existing Lexicons, which will get saved as JSON files in `./lexicons/`:\n"
msgstr "プロジェクトディレクトリで既存のLexiconをダウンロードすると、`./lexicons/`にJSONファイルとして保存されます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```markdown\n"
"$ goat lex pull com.atproto.repo.strongRef com.atproto.moderation. app.bsky.actor.profile\n"
" 🟢 com.atproto.repo.strongRef\n"
" 🟢 com.atproto.moderation.defs\n"
" 🟢 com.atproto.moderation.createReport\n"
" 🟢 app.bsky.actor.profile\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```markdown\n"
"$ goat lex pull com.atproto.repo.strongRef com.atproto.moderation. app.bsky.actor.profile\n"
" 🟢 com.atproto.repo.strongRef\n"
" 🟢 com.atproto.moderation.defs\n"
" 🟢 com.atproto.moderation.createReport\n"
" 🟢 app.bsky.actor.profile\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also create a new Lexicon record with `goat lex new record`:\n"
msgstr "`goat lex new record`を使って新しいLexiconレコードを作成できます。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```markdown\n"
"$ goat lex new record dev.project.thing\n"
msgstr ""
"```markdown\n"
"$ goat lex new record dev.project.thing\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$ open ./lexicons/dev/project/thing.json\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"$ open ./lexicons/dev/project/thing.json\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "And eventually publish it with `goat lex publish`:\n"
msgstr "最後に`goat lex publish`で公開します。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```markdown\n"
"$ goat lex publish\n"
" 🟢 dev.project.thing\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"```markdown\n"
"$ goat lex publish\n"
" 🟢 dev.project.thing\n"
"```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/guides/publishing-lexicons/en.mdx:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Refer to the [Lexicon Style Guide](/guides/lexicon-style-guide) for guidance on creating new Lexicons.\n"
msgstr "新しいLexiconを作成する際は、[Lexiconスタイルガイド](/guides/lexicon-style-guide)を参照してください。\n"

